This repository aggregates AI agent "skills" and "plugins" from multiple
authors, each under its own license. See ATTRIBUTION.md for the source and
license of every component.

Most of the plugin bundles (engineering-advanced-skills, engineering-skills,
product-skills, business-growth-skills, finance-skills) and the brand-guidelines
skill originate from https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills and are
distributed under the MIT License, reproduced below. Other components carry
their own licenses (e.g. frontend-design is Apache-2.0) or have no stated
license — see ATTRIBUTION.md before redistributing.

